---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
const extraHead = ``;
---
<Base
  title={'Indiev Becomes a DesignRush Accredited Agency'}
  description={'Indiev Becomes a DesignRush Accredited Agency'}
  canonical="https://www.indiev.org/sp/indiev-becomes-a-designrush-accredited-agency"
>
  <Navbar />
<section class="experts_hero">
<div class="main_container">
<p class="expert_hero_text">Your Story, Our Craft</p>
<h1 class="experts_title">Indiev<br/>Becomes <br/>a DesignRush Accredited <br/>Agency</h1>
</div>
<div class="expert_hero_image_container"><img alt="IndievBecomes a DesignRush Accredited Agency" class="seo_image" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1456px) 100vw, 1456px" src="/images/design-rush.webp" srcset="/images/design-rush-p-500.webp 500w, /images/design-rush-p-800.webp 800w, /images/design-rush-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/design-rush.webp 1456w" title="IndievBecomes a DesignRush Accredited Agency"/></div>
</section><section class="design_text">
<div class="main_container">
<p class="rush_text">    At Indiev, we are thrilled to announce that we have become an accredited agency with <a href="https://www.designrush.com/agency/social-media-marketing/trends/alternative-social-media" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DesignRush</a>, a prestigious B2B marketplace that connects businesses with top-rated agencies. This accreditation is a testament to our dedication to providing exceptional digital content and innovative marketing solutions tailored to meet the diverse needs of our clients.</p><img alt="deasign rush" class="rush_awards" loading="lazy" src="/images/rush.svg"/>
<p class="rush_text button_text">   DesignRush is renowned for its rigorous evaluation process, ensuring that only the best agencies receive accreditation. With around 450,000 B2B visitors monthly and top rankings in Google search, this partnership is set to significantly enhance our visibility and attract more leads and inquiries for our business.<br/>   As a DesignRush accredited agency, Indiev will now be featured in upcoming press releases, highlighting our capabilities and success stories to a broader audience. This exposure not only bolsters our reputation but also opens new avenues for collaboration and growth.<br/>   We invite you to explore our comprehensive range of services, from video editing and motion design to web development and content creation. Our unique subscription model ensures that our clients have access to dedicated creative resources, enabling them to bring their marketing ideas to life with ease and efficiency.For more information, visit our [DesignRush profile]  and see how Indiev can elevate your digital content strategy. We look forward to leveraging this new partnership to deliver even greater value to our clients.<br/>   Are you ready to transform your marketing with Indiev? Join us on this exciting journey and let’s create something extraordinary together.</p>
<div class="cofaounder_container">
<div class="image_rush_conatiner"></div>
<div class="text_cofounder">
<p class="cof_title">Yaro Korets</p>
<p class="text_cof">Co-Founder<br/></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
  <Footer />
  <Fragment set:html={extraHead} />
</Base>
